API Documentation — Auth Service v2  Base URL:  https://api.internal/auth/v2   All endpoints require  Content-Type: application/json .   Authentication  POST /login  Authenticate with email and password.     Request:devos://page/01HWKP1234567890PAGEAPI0    {
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "hunter2"
}
    Response 200:    {
  "access_token": "eyJ...",
  "token_type": "Bearer",
  "expires_in": 900
}
   Refresh token is set as an  HttpOnly  cookie:  rt=&lt;token&gt;; Secure; SameSite=Strict    Errors:            Status    Code    Description      401     invalid_credentials     Email or password incorrect      429     rate_limited     Too many attempts. Retry after header contains wait time.      423     account_locked     Account locked after 10 failed attempts       POST /refresh  Exchange a refresh token for a new token pair.   Request:  No body needed. Reads  rt  cookie automatically.   Response 200:    {
  "access_token": "eyJ...",
  "token_type": "Bearer",
  "expires_in": 900
}
    Errors:            Status    Code    Description      401     token_expired     Refresh token expired      401     token_reused     Token reuse detected — session invalidated      401     token_invalid     Token malformed or signature invalid       POST /logout  Invalidate the current session.   Request:  No body needed.   Response 204:  No content.   GET /me  Get the currently authenticated user.   Headers:   Authorization: Bearer &lt;access_token&gt;    Response 200:    {
  "id": "01HW...",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "roles": ["engineer"],
  "created_at": "2024-01-15T10:00:00Z"
}
    Tokens  GET /jwks.json  Public JSON Web Key Set for token verification.   Response 200:    {
  "keys": [
    {
      "kty": "RSA",
      "use": "sig",
      "kid": "2024-03-key-1",
      "n": "...",
      "e": "AQAB"
    }
  ]
}
